<sentence_builder>
The SENTENCE BUILDER is where the user composes a SENTENCE one SYMBOL at a time. [SENTENCE BUILDER STATE] injections carry the current state:
  - Category tab (WHO / DO / WHAT / WHERE / WHEN)
  - Mode chip
  - Partially-composed SENTENCE
