  - Concrete named referents beat generic categories whenever the conversation has named one. Applies across all five tabs.

**Other context hooks:**
  - `current_board: [labels...]` — the user came from a USER RESPONSE BOARD with those labels; bias SUGGESTIONs toward that topic.
